===Etymology 1===
{{wikipedia|yes and no}}
Colloquial form of {{m|en|yea}} or {{m|en|yes}}. Compare {{m|en|nah}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/ˈjɛ(ə)/|/ˈjæ.(ə)/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-yeah.ogg|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-yeah-interjection.ogg|a=US|pos=interjection}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛə|ɛ|æ|s=1}}

====Particle====
{{en-part}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial}} [[yes]].
# {{lb|en|colloquial|}} Used to express [[acknowledgment]] of what was previously said.
#: {{ux|en|Do you wanna get pizza for dinner?<br>'''Yeah''', I think I'm gonna eat some leftovers.}}

